ey'.g:rtm_api_key.q)\nendfunction```\nAfter(denops)\n```  static generateApiSig(apiKey: string, apiSecretKey: string, params: string[]) {\n    const q: string = apiSecretKey + \"api_key\" + apiKey + params.join(\"\");\n    return createHash(\"md5\").update(q).toString();\n  }```\n型で保護されつつ、シュッと書けた（気がする）ので満足 :ultrafastparrot:","ts":"1626490700.491800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"57yl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9B8606B9-972C-4334-AF95-6912E4692059","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"あーなるほど","ts":"1626487809.490100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rqgd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9757d263-3e61-4091-b538-ef070d526d6c","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"そういえばポート指定できるようにコマンドに引数生やしたはいいけど、あれ文字列として送られてしまうからバリデーションした上でnumberにキャストする手段を考えないといけないんだった","ts":"1626487270.489800","edited":{"user":"U01D44KSY9Z","ts":"1626487274.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kH/s3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84b31995-486a-4759-9d08-eabe82a4e542","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"TCPポートを固定で一つ塞ぐので自動起動するなら多重起動のチェックしないといけないんですよね\nそれがめんどくさい\u0026amp;時間なくてまだやってないです","ts":"1626487188.488800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dBy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F9BD4CBB-F01A-4189-8C9D-79E4CEBA5C28","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"あれ、自動起動するようにしないんですか？","ts":"1626487121.487900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cDz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6A13CA3A-91E7-4F7D-B130-F43003029403","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"Ghost使っていきたい","ts":"1626487098.487300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GyCer"}]},{"client_msg_id":"abbcba4f-0a38-45bc-a7f4-c0ff680de666","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"~ちなみにGhostTextはユニットテストとか書ける気がしないのでゴリ押し人力e2eテストやってます~","ts":"1626486907.486800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"aruaru","count":2,"users":["U776661HA","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PFxGX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4a94b96-2b03-43d3-b7c9-c9888771633e","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"普段、あまりユニットテストを書いてないことがばれてしまった…（ ；´。 ｀；）\nオブジェクトに依存するより、文字列に依存するほうがはるかに単純でいいですね。\n複雑に考えすぎていたようです。ありがとうございました！","ts":"1626486776.485800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]},{"name":"warau","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FXVg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d4bbe04-f60f-4709-b747-ebe1d2583eca","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"テストしやすいし再現性が良くなります","ts":"1626486713.485000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tmJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23024bbb-d42d-404b-8db7-93d7f86cd23d","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"可能な限り denops 依存の場所を小さくしたほうが良いですね","ts":"1626486706.484700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"71yG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"efc17ac5-ece4-49cf-b269-6cda6c38baaf","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"関数の機能としては変数の取得は切り離した方がテストもしやすい気がするんですよね","ts":"1626486582.483400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U72TB62UF"]},{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zp29m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9233ca40-9688-4a13-af9d-00d68a6b9561","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"単純に文字列渡すだけの方が、auth.tsから Denopsの依存がなくなって良い気がしてきた…","ts":"1626486572.483100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MNZ/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05b9deca-6314-484e-9883-40f0d92af87f","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"\u0026gt; 完全に邪推ですが `Auth.generateApiSig()` というのが「任意のAPI キーを利用して API のシグネチャを作る」関数だと仮定した場合、そこに Vim/Neovim の機能は不要なので `Auth.generateApiSig(apiKey: string): string` みたいな形の関数にして、普通に `Deno.test` で Vim/Neovim の関与がない状態でテストするのが良さそうかなと思いました\n最初にやろうと考えていたのはコレでしたが、main.tsでapiKeyを使うことはないと考えていたので、\nauth.tsで var.g.get() できれば、main.tsから不要な変数を取り除けるかなーと考えてやっていました。","ts":"1626486489.482100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CEwb6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01d22b33-7e8d-4826-852e-988e6abd36ab","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"なるほど `var.g.get(...)` はテスト済みの関数なので、それをテストする必要はなさそうです","ts":"1626486330.479700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IhpnS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f687da02-5c2a-4384-aec0-31ab17a17677","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"できれば g:xxx を触るテストがよかろうと思っていじっていた感じです。","ts":"1626486294.479200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3DF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"393650c9-2196-4bec-817c-eb16e31e3ade","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"完全に邪推ですが `Auth.generateApiSig()` というのが「任意のAPI キーを利用して API のシグネチャを作る」関数だと仮定した場合、そこに Vim/Neovim の機能は不要なので `Auth.generateApiSig(apiKey: string): string` みたいな形の関数にして、普通に `Deno.test` で Vim/Neovim の関与がない状態でテストするのが良さそうかなと思いました","ts":"1626486292.479100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bw2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3cacd145-f32d-41d3-8116-ba7718574900","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"事前定義とは、 `await vars.g.set(\"rtm_secret_key\", \"yyy\");` しておくということでしょうか。\n確かに、本番で使う値だと、テスト用のデータが実行する人によって違ってきますね…","ts":"1626486278.478500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J0fDG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41cda5c5-df37-40e4-a5e2-1b26faa7f83e","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"`test()` は Vim/Neovim を実際に動かすとはいえ e2e テストではなくユニットテストですね","ts":"1626486140.476200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U72TB62UF"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GAaCS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"028d74e3-a8f4-43d8-8221-b0e8b5ad4493","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"そもそも手元の環境に左右されたらテストが意味を為さないですし","ts":"1626486122.475800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U776661HA","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9VLD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1f8b83b9-e61f-4195-923f-74508b66c2df","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"main.tsを動かすデバッグメソッドがあるので、いいといえばいいのですが。","ts":"1626486089.474900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wyqe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eca3c3bf-ab81-4011-936b-03d1bb8fa3e8","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"（事前定義すればよいのよ）","ts":"1626486082.474600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UwM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5019344-2dae-444b-8f54-0fd112385ae6","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"テストコード内で定義するとかですかね","ts":"1626486081.474500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vLDr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21ec3882-e1e0-4c3d-ba66-139bc7ef41ca","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"となると、現状だと `vars.g.xxx()` はユニットテストだと難しそうな感じですね。","ts":"1626486059.473800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v53J="}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f0987c3-d29a-4d4b-a9ba-29e308ed36cb","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"testの細かい実装まで把握してないので断言はできませんが","ts":"1626485993.472400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yYDJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94fd68fa-58f5-48f9-be7c-cc3d4502a699","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ですね\nそもそもvimrcも読まれないはず","ts":"1626485977.472100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YQG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"791fcdcc-9e0f-46d7-80b3-9806073590dd","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"`.vim/rc/rtm.vim` で定義していて、 .vimrcで sourceで読み込んでます。\nって、まっさらなvimだから、こんな深いところまで見てくれない…？","ts":"1626485960.471800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oIe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e0d73fa-155e-4e20-8b37-dab41f895628","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"`g:rtm_secret_key` はどこで定義されてます？","ts":"1626485863.470600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dZWh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66b5f357-22ea-40c1-a152-10d3e0a50b32","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"```import { Denops } from \"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/denops_std@v1.0.0-beta.2/mod.ts\u003e\";\nimport { execute } from \"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/denops_std@v1.0.0-beta.2/helper/mod.ts\u003e\";\nimport { Auth } from \"./auth.ts\";\n\nexport async function main(denops: Denops): Promise\u0026lt;void\u0026gt; {\n  denops.dispatcher = {\n    async echo(text: unknown): Promise\u0026lt;unknown\u0026gt; {\n      const a = new Auth();\n      const key = await a.generateApiSig(denops);\n      console.log(key);\n\n      return await Promise.resolve(text);\n    },\n  };\n\n  await execute(\n    denops,\n    `command! -nargs=1 HelloWorldEcho echomsg denops#request('${denops.name}', 'echo', [\u0026lt;q-args\u0026gt;])`\n  );\n}```\nZennのサンプルをデバッグコードに流用しているので、メソッド名は適当です。\nやっていることは、generateApiSig()を呼んでconsole.log()するのみです。","ts":"1626485789.469800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EVw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59492390-e955-451e-a1ac-a0189d3cfc1d","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"そうなるとmain.tsの中身も気になりますね","ts":"1626485651.468500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"42J3r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08f047c9-0fc8-4ccb-838a-9204d0607197","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"main.tsでやっていることは denops.dispatcher くらいなので、これがないとダメかなぁ。","ts":"1626485625.468300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y0R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2895ad4-dbe0-4b85-80f3-9c92507c23b9","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"なので網羅的にプラグインのテストをしたいならプラグイン内の関数を一つ一つimportして実行しないといけないはず","ts":"1626485619.468100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wLoa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c2fa0b0-7fdc-4ce8-b733-7e7765e2b63f","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"testはまっさらなVimにdenopsだけ読み込ませてテストコードの中身だけを実行するので、テストコードの中で定義されてない変数は定義されないですね","ts":"1626485562.467100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"100","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dldzt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"751a5bff-c5e4-452d-9ce4-352218fe8f77","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"```test({\n  mode: \"all\",\n  name: \"Auth for RTM\",\n  fn: async (denops: Denops) =\u0026gt; {\n    console.log(denops);\n    const auth = new Auth();\n    assertEquals(await auth.generateApiSig(denops), \"ok\", undefined);\n  },\n});```\nコードはこんな感じで、\n\n```running 2 tests from file:///Users/takets/.vim/plugged/rtm_deno/denops/tests/auth.test.ts\ntest Auth for RTM (vim) ...DenopsImpl {\n  name: \"@denops-core-test\",\n  meta: { platform: \"mac\", host: \"vim\", mode: \"test\", version: \"8.2.\" }\n}```\ndenopsの値も取れていると考えています。","ts":"1626485437.465500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sMMCI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6770ec91-46f5-423c-b094-8ac55b5b58e0","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"テストは `main.ts` の自動読み込みとかしないです","ts":"1626485398.464800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xol9+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09db15a3-b5a5-4896-9ac5-15633b812652","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"test内で変数の定義はしてありますか？","ts":"1626485345.464300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L9s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5030cc0b-ad3e-4c72-9759-63f1f3b5d866","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"vimの変数 `g:xxx` を返却するメソッドを以下のように定義して、deno testしたのですが、nullが返却されます。\n\n```  async generateApiSig(denops: Denops) {\n    return await vars.g.get(denops, \"rtm_secret_key\");\n  }\n\n❯ deno test --allow-env --allow-net --allow-run --unstable  auth.test.ts```\nmain.tsから実行すると値を取得できるのですが、deno testのときのみ結果が異なります。\n他に実行パラメータを追加する必要などありますでしょうか。","ts":"1626485245.463900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fhW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b1b136f-0c42-4824-9673-e2b8ac2e3487","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"denoのキャッシュを飛ばしたら治りました。失礼しました。","ts":"1626481396.461500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":3,"users":["U776661HA","U7JL1UKKL","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CpVj3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db80889f-5aec-45f5-97c5-bc5e2eb007f7","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"denopsのテストを以下のように書いてみたのですが、テストが無視されたというメッセージが出ます。\n\n```import { assertEquals } from \"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/denops_std@v1.0.0-beta.8/deps_test.ts\u003e\";\nimport { test } from \"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/denops_std@v1.0.0-beta.8/deps_test.ts\u003e\";\n\ntest({\n  mode: \"all\",\n  name: \"Auth for RTM\",\n  fn: async () =\u0026gt; {\n    await assertEquals(\"ok\", \"ok\", undefined);\n  },\n});```\n```❯ deno test --allow-env\nrunning 2 tests from file:///Users/takets/.vim/plugged/rtm_deno/denops/tests/auth.test.ts\ntest Auth for RTM (vim) ... ignored (0ms)\ntest Auth for RTM (nvim) ... ignored (0ms)\n\ntest result: ok. 0 passed; 0 failed; 2 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out (68ms)```\nMac環境で、以下の環境設定を追加した状態での実行結果なのですが、他に必要な設定などありますでしょうか。\n\n```DENOPS_TEST_VIM=/usr/local/bin/vim\nDENOPS_PATH=/Users/takets/.vim/plugged/denops.vim\nDENOPS_TEST_NVIM=/usr/local/bin/nvim```\n","ts":"1626480298.461000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QAa6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9278a8f8-0444-4695-b7bf-41cc774291cc","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"unknownutil便利すぎる…","ts":"1626453785.459200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS","UL6CFN8NR"]},{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fGaNb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a46d9b98-1470-4970-863d-3bddc37328e6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":bow:","ts":"1626451845.459000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mky"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c126de01-2611-4e5b-8b28-16b61f49fb99","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"\u003c@U776661HA\u003e すみません、テスト書いてる段階でunknownutil使いたくなったんですが依存増やしてしまっても大丈夫です？","ts":"1626450793.458700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","b